</tbody>
</table>
</span></div>
</figure>
<div id="S4.SS2.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S4.SS2.p2.1" class="ltx_p">As shown in Table <a href="#S4.T1" title="Table 1 ‣ 4.2 Results ‣ 4 Experiment ‣ ECG-aBcDe: Overcoming Model Dependence, Encoding ECG into a Universal Language for Any LLM" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>, in the within-dataset evaluation, ECG-aBcDe achieves comparable performance to state-of-the-art methods in terms of ROUGE-L and METEOR, while significantly outperforming them in BLEU-4 with a score of 42.58. These results demonstrate that ECG-aBcDe outperforms existing methods in capturing both lexical and phrasal correspondences, consequently producing higher-quality text with closer alignment to reference descriptions.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S4.T2" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2: </span>Results of Zero-Shot Cross-Dataset Transfer</figcaption>
<div id="S4.T2.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:337.0pt;height:73.2pt;vertical-align:-34.1pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(0.0pt,0.0pt) scale(1.0,1.0) ;">
<table id="S4.T2.2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="S4.T2.2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S4.T2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt"><span id="S4.T2.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Method</span></th>
<th id="S4.T2.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt"><span id="S4.T2.2.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Tr. Data</span></th>
<th id="S4.T2.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt"><span id="S4.T2.2.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Inf. Data</span></th>
<th id="S4.T2.2.1.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt"><span id="S4.T2.2.1.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">BLEU-4</span></th>
<th id="S4.T2.2.1.1.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt"><span id="S4.T2.2.1.1.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Rouge-L</span></th>
<th id="S4.T2.2.1.1.6" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt"><span id="S4.T2.2.1.1.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Meteor</span></th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="S4.T2.2.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
